WEBVTT

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.230
A few more moments.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.150
Wait that long. That's all I ask for, Katalina.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:22.040
While I exterminate these pests for you.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.720
A-Adversa is...

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:58.930
Where's the general?

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.430
Flagship, do you read me?
Answer me! Control room!

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.310
Is that...

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.140
...a person?

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.980
It's that woman! Fire on her now!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.440
All ships, prepare for bombardment!

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.860
Fire!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.200
Over there! Hurry!

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.170
Mommy!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.470
Lady Vira?

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.470
So this is Luminiera's power...

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.680
Vira...

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.810
I'm coming to you now, Katalina.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:32.810
Here she comes!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.070
Gran!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.710
I apologize for making you wait, Katalina.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.300
Please, stop this, Vira.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.420
It will be over soon.
Let's have some tea afterwards.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.140
I have some fine tea leaves.

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.470
I'm sure you'll like them, too.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.720
Would you like some apple pie to go with it?

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:14.400
Oh, perhaps you'd rather have sandwiches?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.150
Vira... You...

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.700
Katalina!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.100
Is everyone okay?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.100
You saved our bacon.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.230
She's terrifying...

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.320
Can't believe she deflected my spell...

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.400
What's the plan?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.110
Could just keep going
and leave the island behind.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.660
I'm sorry.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.500
For leaving the ship,
without explaining myself...

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:24.510
Years ago, at Vira's expense,
I realized my dream of becoming a knight.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.140
I forced her to shoulder everything,

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.010
and this is what she's become
after turning my back on her.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:36.810
I must take responsibility for my past mistakes.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:38.400
Which is why...

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.860
Yep, thought so.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.830
Let's take care of this right away!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.950
We'd do anything for you, Katalina!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:59.210
Besides, wouldn't be our first time
with a primal, now would it?

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.710
We'll help Vira see your feelings.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.300
Katalina.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.640
You're a member of our crew, remember?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.470
Thank you.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.440
Straight ahead!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.760
Continue on to the castle!

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.100
Found it!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.100
If we use this...

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:58.390
Lyria, give me a hand!

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.350
Io?

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:00.810
Gran!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.270
Can you buy us just a little time?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.080
Lord of the skies, king of all creation...

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:33.090
Why would you shield such people, Katalina?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.550
Just hear me out, Vira.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:36.680
Katalina!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:45.310
You are a nuisance,
a mere obstacle to Katalina and I!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:49.360
Just listen to what Katalina has to say.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.360
You're nothing but a clueless child!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.570
Don't you dare utter Katalina's name!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.870
The primordial gold gathers from
the emptiness beyond and shines forth...

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:04.380
Gran!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.290
Please do not resist.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:17.970
Don't do this!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.890
It's all over now.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.110
Did he get 'em?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.490
He hit one of her annoying floaty things!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.700
Don't get ahead of yourselves.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:35.610
- Eugen!
- Old man!

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.700
Steadfast tree that towers above...

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.700
Mysterious tides that rampage below...

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.380
Vira!

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:51.130
Wait for me, please, Katalina.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.300
Gran!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.610
Stop it, Vira!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:11.610
You should be directing your rage against me!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.360
Raging hellfire that blazes within...

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.580
You will never come between us again.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.620
Take of my vow, and heed my call!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:32.920
Please...

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.130
Look her in the eye...

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.600
Face Katalina!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.140
Gran!

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.400
Katalina...

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.280
Are you all right?

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:01.160
A diversion, is it?

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:07.120
Wrath of the seas, serpent of the raging abyss!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.000
Thy name is... Leviathan!

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.580
Don't you dare...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.130
...come between us again!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:57.300
It's all over for you now!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:59.400
Why won't you listen to me, Katalina?

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.740
I should've done this long ago.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.620
To become a loyal knight
who would protect the people.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.330
That was your dream.

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:17.210
I defeated you that day, six years ago,
because I realized how you felt.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:19.760
And yet...

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:24.220
That child led you astray, deceived you,
and stole your dream from you.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.430
I wanted you to make your dream a reality.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.060
I wanted you to be happy.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.770
I would have done anything,
if it was for your sake!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.360
Even my duties as Lord Commander were bearable,
so long as I remembered it was all for you!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.570
And yet, why?!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.500
I've allowed you to sacrifice yourself.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:13:00.750
I took advantage of your kindness,
stripped you of your freedom,

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.880
and chose my dream over you.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.130
But...

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:08.050
I understand now, for the first time.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.760
What it is that makes someone a true knight,

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:15.100
and why I should wield my sword.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:18.360
It's all thanks to you.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:22.990
Without the freedom you gave me,
I never would've known.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:28.700
Thanks to you, I was able to see
what path I should take—

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:29.530
No!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.410
No! You're wrong!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.580
You're not the Katalina that I know!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.500
I'll never acknowledge you as you are now!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.250
My memories of those days
meant everything to me!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:45.300
The days that I spent with you
are what kept me going.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:49.260
All I could do was think about you!

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.310
All you have to do is be
the Katalina that I require.

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:58.480
If I'm by your side, you will never err again...

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:03.570
Please stay with me forever.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.820
I will gladly protect you.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.280
I thought that was what I should do, too.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.950
Since I'd let you suffer by sacrificing yourself,

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:16.250
I thought it was my turn to live for your sake.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.330
Then—

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.120
But that would amount to nothing!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:25.970
It would just be me sacrificing myself this time,
the same thing happening all over again.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.380
Nothing would change.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:35.720
Sacrifice doesn't lead to happiness.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.520
Both me, and you...

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:43.150
We should choose a path
that will lead to happiness.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:50.360
You...

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.660
If you hadn't...

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.490
If it wasn't for you!

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.300
What have I...

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.510
What have I...

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.140
Why...

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:22.940
Let's talk again, just like we did back then.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:26.110
About the last six years of my life,

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:30.200
and the six years of yours...

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:34.120
We haven't done any catching up yet, have we?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.410
I...

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:41.750
I would've been happy, as long as I had you...

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:49.220
This is the path that
I choose now as a knight.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:58.470
Vira...

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.810
Forgive me for not coming
to see you all this time.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.400
I'm sorry that I left you all alone.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:11.150
There's so much I want to talk to you about.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.320
Let's start all over again.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:18.450
All right.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:30.340
Seriously. Try not to be so reckless next time.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.800
Sorry about that.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:41.790
Lyria, what did you just do?

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.750
It's all right.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:48.040
I had Luminiera place part
of her power inside me.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:53.800
Vira, it might take a little time,

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.800
but you're free now
to go anywhere you want.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.140
You mean she's no longer bound?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:10.310
But Vira is still Luminiera's master.
She says that she'd still like to stay by your side.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.230
Vira?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.360
What a selfish guardian spirit...

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.750
To think that she was able
to dissolve Luminiera's hold...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.340
And here I thought she could only take powers...

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.960
Does that mean she's developed a bit?

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:40.590
Or is it because she's linked to you, I wonder?

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.310
Let us meet again, Captain.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.440
Could you please reconsider one more time?

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.110
You're still going on about that, Gran?

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.700
I'd like you to join our crew and travel with us.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:08.540
It's a truly tempting proposal,
but I'll have to decline this time.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.790
I'd like a chance to reflect on everything.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.920
Everything that I've averted my gaze from till now...

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.010
As well as the path I should choose going forward.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.970
I have complete faith in you, Vira.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.160
Please have these during your travels.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.370
They look yummy!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.870
But you didn't put anything weird in 'em, did ya?

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:47.950
Vyrn!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:50.960
Thank you so much!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:58.010
If you ever put Katalina in danger,
there will be hell to pay.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.880
So protect her with everything you've got.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.340
R-Right!

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.660
Until we meet again, Vira.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.030
Yes, Katalina.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.800
This is all we were able to retrieve from Agastia.

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.180
Oh, my! How utterly suspicious!

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.520
She's definitely up to no good!

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:18.940
That weasel...

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:21.980
From here on, we act separately.

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:24.400
You mean we're going to take a break?

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:27.110
That's our Black Knight! So generous!

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:30.950
Ouch! Don't stab me, Sturm!

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:33.330
So Orchis will be joining us?

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:36.040
I entrust her to you.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:40.170
Don't lose her, no matter what. Anything else?

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:43.000
Goodbye, then.

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:02.730
Now, then, it looks like we're out of a job,
so what now, Sturm?

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:04.360
You need to shut up, Drang.

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:07.860
But we're finally on a break!
We might as well enjoy it.

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:10.240
You, too, Orchis. How about a big smile?

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:14.970
Oh, right, I know that reaction.

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.500
If we're going somewhere,
it should be inconspicuous.

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.960
Hey, how about the sea?

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:20.540
We can have a blast in Auguste...

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:21.670
Ouch!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:23.420
Shut up if you don't want to get stabbed.

00:23:23.420 --> 00:23:25.550
Don't warn me after you've already stabbed me!

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.380
Really... If you don't have anything
particular in mind,

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:33.800
there's somewhere I'd like to go.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
EXTRA 2
JACK-O'-LANTERN

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.100
Next episode, "Jack O' Lantern."
